    "turn_text": "Did it even seem reasonable to you that you could have? hold a constitutional convention in a two-week or month-long special session. Last time a constitution was rewritten, it took over a year to do. It was a painstaking process. Now, I know it's 50 years later, but I don't think things have advanced that quickly, have they?",
