    "turn_text": "Well, I would hope not. I would hope not. But you may be right. I just think that there is a sense from Americans that they want to cease fire. They want to stop the killings. And a lot of that is in his hands. And I would hope that that he would listen to the political leaders that he have spoken with. And hopefully when he goes to Florida, he'll get the same message. But if he gets a different message, I would hope that he stays on message. But it's really up to him as to how he how he acts when he gets to Florida. I would hope that he received the message because people don't want to see a whole bunch of more innocent babies killed in Gaza because there's really at this point no reason. We need to cease fire, cease the firing, and we need to end this war and move to, you know, to state solution to this problem. Almost done. Take your",
